# Normalize all text to LF in the repo and on checkout, on every platform.
# Without this, a Windows clone (core.autocrlf=true) checks out CRLF; verify.mjs
# is CRLF-tolerant regardless, but pinning LF keeps the map bytes identical everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
